{
  "text": "On the authority of Abu Amr, and he is also given as Abu Amrah, Sufyan ibn Abdullah, may Allah be pleased with him, who said, I said, O Messenger of Allah, tell me something about Islam, which I can ask of no one but you. He said, Say, I believe in Allah, and thereafter be upright. It was related by Muslim.",
